From 6c6c0fa7f7e9a266681d92c4d8d1177352c8d78f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Grimaldi <vincenzo@igrimaldi.engineering>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 13:33:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: capability register with provenance + filterable
 work registry

Adds app/lib/registry.ts as the single source of truth for what Vincenzo
can actually do and what he has actually shipped. Every capability entry
names the employer, thesis or public repository where it was exercised;
entries without provenance are not admitted.

Selecting a capability domain filters the work registry beneath it, so a
claim and its evidence stay in one field of view. Project status is stated
as 'shipped' or 'in development' rather than implied.
